train-512-images-idx3-ubyte, train-512-labels-idx1-ubyte,
t10k-128-images-idx3-ubyte and t10k-128-labels-idx1-ubyte are the first 512
training and first 128 test records of Fashion-MNIST
(https://github.com/zalandoresearch/fashion-mnist), with the record count in
each header rewritten; all other bytes unchanged. They are cut from the four
.gz archives on torchvision's mirror, checked against torchvision's MD5s. To
regenerate them:

    racket scripts/fashion-mnist-fixture.rkt [OUT_DIR]

OUT_DIR defaults to this directory. The archives download once into the
cache directory, or RKTORCH_FASHION_MNIST_DIR.

